  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5504.02 Distribution of DSSP 311.\n\n(a) Within 5 days of completion of form DSSP 311, the local law enforcement agency shall distribute the form as specified in Saf-C 5503.01(c).\n\n(b) Upon receipt of the copy of the form, the division shall enter the information into the SOR.\n\nSource. #5537, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6314, EMERGENCY eff 8-9-96, EXPIRES: 12-7-96; ss by #6324, INTERIM eff 8-22-96, EXPIRES: 12-20-96; ss by #6358, eff 10-22-96; ss by #6919, INTERIM, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRES: 5-1-99; ss by #6990, EMERGENCY, eff 4-30-99, EXPIRES: 8-28-99; ss by #7066, eff 7-28-99, EXPIRED: 7-29-07\n\nNew. #10121, eff 4-25-12; ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
